<p id="S5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Table <a href="#S5.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ 5.2 Explicit Blacklist Statistics ‣ 5 Experimental Results ‣ Inverting Trojans in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> reports the number of tokens filtered under different
blacklist thresholds for both classes.</span></p>
</div>
